WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
LocalPass: small AI for offline development.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.100
Most AI assumes stable bandwidth. Not everyone has that.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:11.900
We split AI preparation from offline execution. Prepare once, run anywhere.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:25.100
Built with React 19, TypeScript, and Vite. IndexedDB stores the destination pack. A cache-first service worker keeps the app itself offline, using shared design tokens from our UI package.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:38.700
The core is 84 lines of deterministic rules, no LLM calls. It extracts hours, budget, and interests from text, scores places, and boosts local businesses. Auditable, instant, zero cost.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:44.000
Offline-first from day one paid off: zero network calls, no hallucinated prices.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:52.700
Honest limits: one destination, nine demo operators. Prices still need local confirmation. No cloud layer, by design.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.700
Shipped with real release discipline.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:01:00.000
LocalPass: useful AI, for the devices and connectivity people actually have.
